    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a visual novel  where you progress through the story. The story unfolds based on the choices presented during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Hyoga, had a life where his chosen actions never seemed to pay off, ever since his childhood. As a high school student with a rough personality, Ayuno, a classmate, treats him kindly. However, Hyoga ends up making unintended choices towards Ayuno.</p>",
